Author: Ingo Kubbilun <ingo.kubbilun@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 12 20:33:10 2026 +0100

    HID: asus-ec: document ASUS Vivobook S16 S3607QA support
    
    The Vivobook S16 S3607QA uses the same keyboard (0B05:4543) as the
    Vivobook S15, so it is already handled; mention it in Kconfig and the
    driver description.
    
    Tested on ASUS Vivobook S16 S3607QA: backlight on/off and levels work,
    the EC's idle pulsing stops once the driver is bound.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DkUieTSPeVK2F2nM8a8WhL
    Signed-off-by: Ingo A. Kubbilun <ingo.kubbilun@gmail.com>

